# Suki: "Whenever another permanent you control leaves the battlefield during your turn, create a 1/1 white Ally creature
# token. This ability triggers only once each turn." Bot1 casts Suki with three Mox Pearls on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot1
# destroys one of its own Mox Pearls (already tapped for mana) with Disenchant: one Ally is made, and "Other creatures you
# control get +1/+0" makes it 2/1. A second Disenchant on the second Mox Pearl the same turn makes no second Ally (once each
# turn). The Ally enters after the first Disenchant, so the pump is seen on a creature that came later.

